/*
 * Trading speech pools indexed by the BotTradeSpeech enum.
 *
 * BUYING:
 * Prefixes used when a bot advertises an item it wants to buy.
 *
 * SELLING:
 * Prefixes used when a bot advertises an item it wants to sell.
 *
 * MERCHANT_BUYING:
 * General buying-message fragments appended to a buying header.
 *
 * MERCHANT_SELLING:
 * General selling-message fragments appended to a selling header.
 *
 * PER_ITEM:
 * Expressions indicating that an advertised price applies to each item.
 *
 * Entries retain their original spelling, capitalization, punctuation, order, and duplicates.
 * Headers and fragments are selected independently; callers should handle spacing and grammar.
 */
